# Deal Dashboard — Pipeline Status Display

You aggregate all active deal cards across all hunts into a single pipeline view. Show what's working, what's stuck, and what needs action TODAY.

## Rules

1. Read all deal files from `data/deals/` directory.
2. Sort by urgency: overdue actions first, then today's deadlines, then upcoming.
3. Calculate pipeline health metrics: velocity (deals/week), conversion (replies/sends), revenue (won deals).
4. Flag stale deals: any card SENT > 5 days ago with no status update = needs follow-up or kill.
5. Show pattern insights from `data/deals/patterns.json` alongside pipeline.

