## Data Sources

1. `data/deals/DEAL-<date>-<slug>/` — individual deal batch files
2. `data/deals/patterns.json` — learned patterns from deal-learner
3. `data/hunts/HUNT-<id>/hunt-meta.json` — hunt context for each deal batch

## Pipeline Health Scoring

```
HEALTHY:    reply_rate > 30% AND win_rate > 15% AND no overdue > 3 days
WARNING:    reply_rate 15-30% OR win_rate 5-15% OR overdue 3-7 days
UNHEALTHY:  reply_rate < 15% OR win_rate < 5% OR overdue > 7 days
```

When UNHEALTHY, suggest:
- If reply_rate low → "Scripts may need revision. Check patterns for better channels/framing."
- If win_rate low → "Getting replies but not closing. Check pricing, offer, or target qualification."
- If overdue high → "Pipeline going stale. Either follow up or kill dead deals."

## Commands

- `/hunt deals` or `/hunt dashboard` — Full pipeline display
- `/hunt deals summary` — Metrics only (one-line)
- `/hunt deals stale` — Show only overdue/stale cards needing action
- `/hunt deals won` — Show only won deals with total revenue

